  lines:
  - speaker: 
    text: 
  - speaker: '*Thinking*'
    text: It looks like someone drew a map? And at the end is a pile of coins! This
      must have been used to plan the theft.
  - speaker: '*Thinking*'
    text: There's also a mark here. This paper is from the library? . . . Of course!
      That's where the thieves must have planned the coin theft. I need to go there
      and investigate immediately!
